        "original_id": "df0567e2-22dc-5e4c-9473-9302ba9e587b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Beauty and the Geek, Beauty and the Beast\n- People: Ashton Kutcher, Jason Goldberg, Nick Santora, Gabrielle-Suzanne Barbot de Villeneuve\n- Concepts: The Ultimate Social Experiment, parody\n\nFacts:\n- In 1740, Gabrielle-Suzanne Barbot de Villeneuve published the traditional fairy tale Beauty and the Beast in La Jeune Américaine et les contes marins.\n- Beauty and the Beast is French-titled La Belle et la Bête.\n- Beauty and the Geek has been advertised as \"The Ultimate Social Experiment.\"\n- Beauty and the Geek is produced by Ashton Kutcher, Jason Goldberg, and Nick Santora.\n- The title Beauty and the Geek parodies the title Beauty and the Beast.",
